### Glib Demo API Testing


### Base URL

@apiBase = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### 

# POSTS API


### 


### Get all posts

GET {{apiBase}}/post/ HTTP/1.1


### Get specific post by ID (replace with actual UUID from response above)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/f7c9b0a0-f8a1-4f3c-b1d4-a6f1b9e5e2d2 HTTP/1.1


### Search posts with query parameters

GET {{apiBase}}/post/search?page=1&limit=10&q=glib&tag=golang HTTP/1.1


### Create a new post

POST {{apiBase}}/post/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author_id": "d1a2d0c0-f8a1-4f3c-b1d4-a6f1b9e5e2d2",
  "body": "This is a test post created via HTTP client to demonstrate the CRUD operations in Glib framework.",
  "published": true,
  "slug": "testing-glib-framework",
  "tags": "golang,testing,demo",
  "title": "Testing Glib Framework"
}


### Update a post (replace with actual UUID)

PUT {{apiBase}}/post/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "This post has been updated via HTTP client.",
  "published": false,
  "title": "Updated Post Title"
}


### Delete a post (replace with actual UUID)

DELETE {{apiBase}}/post/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1


### Export posts as CSV (Raw HTTP handler)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/export HTTP/1.1


### Stream posts via SSE (Raw HTTP handler - will stream 3 events)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/stream HTTP/1.1


### Health check (no middleware)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/health HTTP/1.1


### 

# COMMENTS API


### 


### Get all comments

GET {{apiBase}}/comment/ HTTP/1.1


### Get specific comment by ID (replace with actual UUID)

GET {{apiBase}}/comment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1


### Create a new comment

POST {{apiBase}}/comment/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Great post! This is a test comment.",
  "post_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "user_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}


### Update a comment (replace with actual UUID)

PUT {{apiBase}}/comment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated comment content"
}


### Delete a comment (replace with actual UUID)

DELETE {{apiBase}}/comment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1


### 

# AUTH API


### 


### Register a new user

POST {{apiBase}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "first_name": "Test",
  "last_name": "User",
  "password": "password123",
  "username": "testuser"
}


### Login

POST {{apiBase}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password123",
  "username": "testuser"
}


### Get current user profile

GET {{apiBase}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer your-token-here


### Logout

POST {{apiBase}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer your-token-here


### 

# ERROR HANDLING EXAMPLES


### 


### 404 - Not Found (invalid post ID)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999 HTTP/1.1


### 400 - Bad Request (missing required fields)

POST {{apiBase}}/post/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing body field"
}


### 400 - Bad Request (invalid UUID format)

GET {{apiBase}}/post/invalid-uuid HTTP/1.1


### 

# MIDDLEWARE TESTING


### 


### Test with Authorization header (protected route)

POST {{apiBase}}/post/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer test-token

{
  "author_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "body": "This tests the auth middleware",
  "title": "Protected Post"
}


### Test rate limiting (send multiple times quickly)

GET {{apiBase}}/comment/ HTTP/1.1


### 

# ADDITIONAL EXAMPLES


### 


### Get posts with pagination

GET {{apiBase}}/post/search?page=1&limit=5 HTTP/1.1


### Get posts with multiple tags

GET {{apiBase}}/post/search?tag=golang&tag=web HTTP/1.1


### Get posts with search query

GET {{apiBase}}/post/search?q=kubernetes HTTP/1.1


### Full text search with filters

GET {{apiBase}}/post/search?q=glib&tag=golang&page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
